<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0134_D47PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">People who come to a Trap House\ntake good care of their homies.\fAin’t that right?\fI’m here for the free water fountain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0134_D47PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After a long hike in the mountains\nlookin’ for a Trap House, right when\fyou ’bout to pass out...\rThen it feel like paradise!\nAir conditionin’. A couch. Free Wi-Fi.</language>
	</row>
</body>
